20
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,500
Saya nak selesaikan
satu urusan peribadi dulu.

21
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,250
Masa itu,

22
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:32,980
kita jumpa di pelabuhan.

23
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:33,850
Si Lobak,

24
00:03:34,050 --> 00:03:35,579
