25
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,530
Baik, awak pun berhati-hati.

26
00:03:38,579 --> 00:03:39,260
Apa kata

27
00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:40,550
biar saya temani awak?

28
00:03:41,070 --> 00:03:41,530
Tak apa,

29
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,090
