30
00:03:48,329 --> 00:03:49,140
Jumpa di pelabuhan.

31
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:50,270
Jumpa di pelabuhan!

32
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:05,010
Arahan daripada
Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman,

33
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:07,420
penjenayah penting disembunyikan di sini,

34
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,890
senjata disimpan secara haram,

35
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:10,210
siasat dengan segera.

36
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,310
Tuan, mungkin ada kesilapan,

37
00:04:14,330 --> 00:04:15,990
kami cuma tukang besi di sini.

38
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:21,100
Sesiapa yang ingkar arahan

39
00:04:21,779 --> 00:04:23,980
akan dihukum mengikut undang-undang.

40
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,800
Siapa kamu?

41
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,850
Atas hak apa kamu tangkap orang?

42
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:49,270
Jangan banyak cakap. Bawa mereka pergi!

43
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,510
- Jalan!
- Jalan, cepatlah!

44
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:53,290
- Cepatlah! Cepat jalan!
- Jalan!

45
00:04:53,290 --> 00:04:54,080
Jalan!

46
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:54,720
Cepatlah!

47
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:56,200
Jangan berlengah-lengah!

48
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,640
Cepat jalan!

49
00:04:57,670 --> 00:05:00,540
[Rumah Pelacuran Kemerahan Mabuk]

50
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:05,010
Saya datang ini.

51
00:05:08,890 --> 00:05:10,740
Kesabaran saya terhad.

52
00:05:12,470 --> 00:05:14,720
Melampau ini, si nakal.

53
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:15,690
Marilah.

54
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:17,170
Marilah awak!

55
00:05:23,450 --> 00:05:24,570
Keluar, Si Xue!

56
00:05:27,810 --> 00:05:28,930
Keluar!

57
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,130
Liu!

58
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,380
Xi!

59
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:35,310
Ambil senjata!

60
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,310
Puan, kenapa?

61
00:05:37,490 --> 00:05:38,340
Masih duduk lagi?

62
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,400
Liu, cepat bangun!

63
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:39,970
Baiklah!

64
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:40,760
Saya pergi tengok sekarang!

65
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,400
Apa yang berlaku?

66
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,050
Cepatlah!

67
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:44,130
Xi, kenapa awak lambat sangat?

68
00:05:44,130 --> 00:05:44,630
Cepatlah!

69
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,510
Apa yang berlaku, puan?

70
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:45,950
Cepatlah!

71
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,480
Kenapa ramai sangat orang?

72
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:49,470
Biar saya pergi tengok!

73
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,480
Si Xue, keluar!

74
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,680
Keluar!

75
00:05:59,170 --> 00:05:59,970
Cepat keluar!

76
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,010
Sini pun tak ada!

77
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,180
Macam ada orang bergaduh.

78
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,710
Entah, apa yang berlaku?

79
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:44,170
Jalan!

80
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:54,840
Saudara!

81
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:55,510
Saudara.

82
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,200
Saudara,

83
00:07:00,490 --> 00:07:01,780
tolong lepaskan saya.

84
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,250
Awak nak apa?

85
00:07:03,450 --> 00:07:05,380
Saya boleh beri awak apa-apa saja.

86
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:07,040
Awak lagi!

87
00:07:07,910 --> 00:07:09,610
Apa sebenarnya yang awak nak buat?

88
00:07:09,610 --> 00:07:11,050
Mana lencana Kong Shiba?

89
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,260
Lencana apa?

90
00:07:13,330 --> 00:07:14,740
Tak ingat, kan?

91
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,970
Kalau tak ingat, tak payah ingat lagi.

92
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:19,090
Ingat!

93
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:22,230
Ada!

94
00:07:28,610 --> 00:07:30,280
Saya pegawai negara Ming.

95
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,180
Awak tahu apa hukumannya

96
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,260
kalau awak bunuh saya?

97
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:37,190
Awak dan Kong Shiba

98
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,970
tiada pertalian darah.

99
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:41,350
Berbaloikah untuk nyawa murahnya?

100
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:48,900
Angkat.

101
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:50,140
Angkat!

102
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:54,060
Dia asalnya pengintip malam
yang menjaga sempadan negara.

103
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:56,550
Dia sepatutnya mati di medan perang,

104
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:58,030
tapi pegawai tak guna macam awak

105
00:07:58,030 --> 00:07:59,800
meracuninya di dalam penjara.

106
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:02,180
Awak kata nyawanya murah?

107
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:04,640
Saya takut akan dia...

108
00:08:20,670 --> 00:08:21,470
Rakan-rakan,

109
00:08:21,670 --> 00:08:22,400
undur!

110
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:23,820
Undur!

111
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,669
Tolong saya...

112
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:37,980
Tolong saya...

113
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:00,170
[Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman,
Huai'an]

114
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:01,480
Tuan.

115
00:09:17,870 --> 00:09:20,130
Ini senarai semua banduan yang ditahan.

116
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:30,980
Mana Hong Wang?

117
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,170
Mana Hong Wang?

118
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:39,960
Saya patut mati.

119
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,930
Orang bernama Hong Wang itu terlalu licik,

120
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:43,390
dia curi-curi tukar mayat

121
00:09:44,710 --> 00:09:46,640
dan larikan diri dalam kekacauan.

122
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,020
Habislah.

123
00:10:04,890 --> 00:10:06,090
Mana putera mahkota?

124
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,150
Dia kata dia ada urusan peribadi.

125
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,250
Nanti kita berjumpa di pelabuhan.

126
00:10:25,970 --> 00:10:26,780
Yulu!

127
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:28,100
Yulu!

128
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:29,770
Yulu!

129
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:31,190
Yulu!

130
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,360
Yulu!

131
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:43,860
Dah tak bernafas.

132
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:46,920
Tak ada.

133
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:51,840
Adik saya dah hilang.

134
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,830
Nampaknya semua dah ditangkap.

135
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,800
Siapa yang buat?

136
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,810
Nak balas dendam.

137
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:04,210
- Cepat jalan!
- Jangan bergerak!

138
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:05,160
Tengok apa?

139
00:11:05,190 --> 00:11:06,790
Cepatlah masuk, dengar tak?

140
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:07,890
- Cepatlah!
- Cepat jalan!

141
00:11:07,890 --> 00:11:08,570
Lepaskan!

142
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:09,720
Awaklah, cepat!

143
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,390
Jangan sentuh saya!

144
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:12,150
Masuk!

145
00:11:12,190 --> 00:11:13,030
Cepatlah masuk!

146
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:14,270
- Masuk!
- Cepat jalan!

147
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,450
Masuk!

148
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,270
Cepatlah!

149
00:11:17,010 --> 00:11:18,370
Pertama, awak tak pakai pakaian seragam.

150
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:20,170
Kedua, awak tiada titah diraja.

151
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:22,520
Kenapa saya kena dengar cakap awak?

152
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,410
Pengikut-pengikut Geng Besi

153
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,870
gunakan senjata api haram

154
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:28,720
untuk buat kecoh sebesar ini
di Kota Huai'an kamu.

155
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,120
Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman kamu
asyik bertangguh

156
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,350
dan buat kerja sambil lewa.

157
00:11:32,350 --> 00:11:33,760
Kamu ini memang tak guna

158
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,610
atau ada niat lain?

159
00:11:36,850 --> 00:11:38,810
Awak anggap Pejabat Cawangan
Jabatan Kehakiman kami ini apa?

160
00:11:38,810 --> 00:11:41,540
Kami cuma cawangan jabatan
yang mengikut arahan.

161
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:43,140
Mula-mula tali kapal putus,

162
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,660
lepas itu pemberontakan penarik kapal.

163
00:11:46,090 --> 00:11:46,990
Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman kami

164
00:11:46,990 --> 00:11:49,610
siasat dan kawal keadaan serta-merta.

165
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:53,090
Ada lagi pemberontakan Geng Besi
yang awak cakap itu,

166
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:55,460
kami tak mampu nak uruskan semuanya
secara serentak.

167
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:56,660
Biar saya tanya awak.

168
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,730
Adakah pengedaran serbuk letupan
dan saltpeter

169
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:00,680
dikawal oleh kerajaan?

170
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:03,280
Bahan senjata api haram Geng Besi

171
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,740
mesti ada sumbernya, kan?

172
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,080
Bukankah kes siasat jenayah
dan membanteras salah laku

173
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,610
di bawah bidang kuasa
Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman kamu?

174
00:12:08,610 --> 00:12:10,010
Biar saya ingatkan awak.

175
00:12:10,130 --> 00:12:11,230
Senjata api

176
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:12,090
muncul

177
00:12:12,110 --> 00:12:14,090
di kawasan Huai'an kamu.

178
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:16,390
Kalau kerajaan siasat,

179
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,970
kamu akan dihukum
atas kecuaian jalankan tugas.

180
00:12:18,970 --> 00:12:20,920
Masa itu, kamu semua

181
00:12:21,350 --> 00:12:22,610
akan terima padahnya!

182
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:23,730
Apa maksud awak?

183
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,040
Sudahlah.

184
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:25,840
Zhan Peng.

185
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:28,730
Sekarang Geng Besi memberontak

186
00:12:28,730 --> 00:12:30,130
dan orang ramai gelisah.

187
00:12:30,130 --> 00:12:32,700
Kes Komander Wang diracuni pun
belum diselesaikan,

188
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:34,890
pihak Pejabat Huai'an pun
tak buat apa-apa.

189
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:37,560
Kenapa awak nak susahkan
pegawai bawahan pangkat tujuh ini?

190
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,220
Yang Mulia.

191
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:42,170
Mohon Yang Mulia siasat dengan jelas.

192
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:44,440
Beta datang ke sini untuk beritahu kamu,

193
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,080
semua pegawai tinggi dan bawahan
di Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman

194
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,500
hanya perlu mengikut arahan.

195
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,100
Zhan Peng.

196
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:48,640
Ya.

197
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:50,210
Segera kerahkan Tentera Yong'an,

198
00:12:50,210 --> 00:12:51,820
suruh mereka sekat jalan air dan darat,

199
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:52,940
hanya boleh masuk, tak boleh keluar,

200
00:12:52,940 --> 00:12:55,280
kerahkan seluruh tenaga
untuk hapuskan sisa Geng Besi.

201
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:57,010
Selain itu,
panggil Komander Tentera Yong'an

202
00:12:57,010 --> 00:12:58,660
berkumpul
di Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman

203
00:12:58,660 --> 00:13:01,660
untuk bincangkan
tentang hal hapuskan pemberontak.

204
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,960
Patik terima arahan.

205
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:10,640
Selain itu, minta
Pejabat Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman

206
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:13,000
tampalkan waran tangkap di seluruh kota

207
00:13:13,170 --> 00:13:15,420
dan kerahkan seluruh tenaga
untuk tangkap sisa pemberontak.

208
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:16,090
Baik,

209
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:18,180
ini memang tugas patik.

210
00:13:24,010 --> 00:13:25,270
Buat kerja baik-baik,

211
00:13:25,590 --> 00:13:27,260
biar beta ingat awak.

212
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,560
Selepas hal ini selesai,

213
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:32,560
ikut beta ke ibu kota
untuk bina masa depan yang cerah.

214
00:13:42,370 --> 00:13:45,140
Ada berita tentang orang
yang saya suruh kamu sambut itu?

215
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:46,330
Semuanya dah diuruskan.

216
00:13:46,330 --> 00:13:47,190
Sila ikut sini.

217
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:56,990
Tabib Su,

218
00:13:57,090 --> 00:13:58,620
kenapa awak datang ke sini?

219
00:13:58,920 --> 00:13:59,750
Sebaik saja sampai di Huai'an,

220
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:02,080
patik dah dengar ada masalah di empangan.

221
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:05,090
Saya terserempak dengan Tabib Su
di Kota Huai'an.

222
00:14:05,090 --> 00:14:06,610
Nasib baik Tabib Su tolong,

223
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:08,410
barulah dapat selamatkan awak.

224
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:09,660
Adik saya

225
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:12,360
dan ahli-ahli Geng Besi dah ditangkap.

226
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,020
Tengoklah ini.

227
00:14:15,590 --> 00:14:18,250
Waran tangkap ini ditampalkan
di seluruh kota.

228
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:25,280
[Hong Wang, Ketua Penjenayah]

229
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:32,300
[Fang Du, Hakim Pejabat
Cawangan Jabatan Kehakiman Huai'an]

230
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,300
Betul,

231
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:37,680
mereka menyasarkan saya.

232
00:14:38,210 --> 00:14:40,040
Awak rasa siapa yang buat?

233
00:14:42,730 --> 00:14:44,630
Kejadian letupan di Jabatan Kehakiman

234
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:46,440
baru berlaku beberapa jam lepas.

235
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,130
Untuk tangkap penjenayah penting,

236
00:14:48,130 --> 00:14:50,330
sekurang-kurangnya
kena ambil masa dua atau tiga hari.

237
00:14:50,330 --> 00:14:52,520
Sekarang seluruh Huai'an dah ditutup.

238
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:55,320
Tentera Yong'an berkawal ketat
di merata tempat.

239
00:14:56,130 --> 00:14:58,060
Siapa yang ada kuasa besar begini?

240
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,440
Pejabat Pengangkutan Terusan
tiada ketua sekarang,

241
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:05,500
tapi boleh buat persiapan besar
dalam masa setengah hari.

242
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,710
Kecuali dia...

243
00:15:07,250 --> 00:15:09,180
Kecuali orang yang berikan arahan

244
00:15:09,250 --> 00:15:11,710
lebih berkuasa daripada tentera tempatan.

245
00:15:11,750 --> 00:15:13,210
Arahan yang diberikannya

246
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,140
